meta {
  name: V2 - Leave Workspace
  type: http
  seq: 131
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/leave
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  x-workspace-id: {{workspaceId}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 400
  res.body.error.code: eq LAST_OWNER
}

docs {
  The only owner gets 400 LAST_OWNER — and by this point in the sequence (after "Remove Member",
  seq 109) {{token}}'s workspace genuinely has only the owner left, so 400 is the correct, exercised
  outcome here. To see a non-owner leave succeed (200), run this with a token belonging to a
  still-current non-owner member instead.
}
